##grflangid 0x01

STR_GRF_NAME                :NJ TRANSIT + PATH Trainset
STR_GRF_DESC                :{ORANGE}NJ TRANSIT + PATH Trainset{}{BLACK}Modern New Jersey rail: ALP-46, ALP-46A and ALP-45DP electrics, the PL42AC diesel, Arrow III EMUs, Comet V coaches, MultiLevel cars, and three generations of PATH rapid transit.{}{}Set {GOLD}Statistics{BLACK} below to choose realistic prototype figures or game-balanced ones.

STR_PARAM_STATS             :Statistics
STR_PARAM_STATS_DESC        :Realistic uses published prototype figures. Game-balanced scales capacity, power, speed and cost so the set sits alongside OpenTTD's own vehicles. Change this before starting a game.
STR_PARAM_REALISTIC         :Realistic
STR_PARAM_BALANCED          :Game-balanced

